  "post_content": "<p>El grup Greenish Blue, format per una xica i tres xics molt joves, va oferir anit a l&#39;auditori de la Uni&oacute; Musical Santa Cec&iacute;lia de Suera un concert de peces cl&agrave;ssiques de jazz dins del cicle que organitza el Servei d&#39;Activitats Socioculturals (SASC) de la Universitat Jaume I (UJI).</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/05/IMG_7273.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Xiomara Abello a la guitarra, Dani Fern&aacute;ndez al baix, Aldo Gonz&aacute;lez a la bateria i Sergio Delcampo a la flauta travessera van oferir versions molts fresques de grans m&uacute;sics de jazz de tots els temps, des de Charlie Parker fins a Keith Jarret.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7261.jpg\" alt=\"img_7261\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7262.jpg\" alt=\"img_7262\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7263.jpg\" alt=\"img_7263\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7265.jpg\" alt=\"img_7265\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7266.jpg\" alt=\"img_7266\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7267.jpg\" alt=\"img_7267\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7268.jpg\" alt=\"img_7268\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7269.jpg\" alt=\"img_7269\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7270.jpg\" alt=\"img_7270\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7271.jpg\" alt=\"img_7271\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7272.jpg\" alt=\"img_7272\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7274.jpg\" alt=\"img_7274\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7276.jpg\" alt=\"img_7276\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7277.jpg\" alt=\"img_7277\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7278.jpg\" alt=\"img_7278\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertjazzsuera/img_7273.jpg\" alt=\"img_7273\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
